{"seq":39,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0394"},"reason":"Added a note explaining why Gotland, not the larger Zealand, is the answer for the Baltic Sea.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gotland"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"Denmark's Zealand is larger than Gotland but lies at the Baltic's edge, between the Kattegat, the Øresund and the Great Belt; Gotland is the largest island wholly surrounded by the Baltic Sea."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Das dänische Seeland ist größer als Gotland, liegt aber am Rand der Ostsee zwischen Kattegat, Öresund und Großem Belt; Gotland ist die größte Insel, die ganz von der Ostsee umgeben ist."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"Датский остров Зеландия больше Готланда, но лежит на краю Балтики, между Каттегатом, Эресунном и Большим Бельтом; Готланд – крупнейший остров, со всех сторон окружённый Балтийским морем."}],"hash":"fd00ed512967","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"606b2194026c0f7c5085489fce7fee9248a3fddd6dcb32dc827285fd9d116e58"},
{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w01970"},"reason":"Denmark's Zealand is larger than Gotland but lies at the Baltic's edge (Kattegat/Øresund/Great Belt), so 'largest island in the Baltic Sea' can be disputed. The question now asks for the largest island lying entirely within the Baltic, which is unambiguously Gotland.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gotland"},{"url":"https://www.worldatlas.com/articles/the-largest-islands-islands-in-the-baltic-sea-by-size.html"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"What is the name of the largest island in the Baltic Sea?","new":"What is the name of the largest island lying entirely within the Baltic Sea?"},{"field":"de","old":"Wie heißt die größte Insel in der Ostsee?","new":"Wie heißt die größte Insel, die vollständig in der Ostsee liegt?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Как называется крупнейший остров Балтийского моря?","new":"Как называется крупнейший остров, целиком лежащий в Балтийском море?"}],"hash":"93c0e6290e3b","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"50820c29adc06503435d912f258222e5c31f1fe08153cd8b847990efc9a3ac94"},
